{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"PMTiles"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/PMTiles"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AnimatedLineExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/WebAPIDataExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/LineStyleLayerExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/DDSCircleLayerExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/POIAlongRouteExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON"],"anchor":"Styling-and-Dynamic-Data","title":"Styling and Dynamic Data"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Starting MapLibre iOS 6.10.0, "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/docs.protomaps.com\/pmtiles\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" archives are supported as tile sources. Prefix any tile source URL with "},{"code":"pmtiles:\/\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to read from a PMTiles archive:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pmtiles:\/\/https:\/\/"},{"text":" — stream tiles from a remote file","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pmtiles:\/\/file:\/\/"},{"text":" — read a file from the device filesystem, including the app bundle","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"pmtiles:\/\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" prefix works with any "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/maplibre.org\/maplibre-style-spec\/sources\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" (e.g. "},{"code":"vector","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"raster","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"raster-dem","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", etc.), from a style JSON or dynamically."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PMTiles sources do not support offline pack downloads or caching."}]}],"type":"aside"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Loading-a-style-that-uses-PMTiles-sources","text":"Loading a style that uses PMTiles sources","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Load a style JSON that references "},{"code":"pmtiles:\/\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" sources. The example below loads a satellite imagery basemap of the Central Alps and sets the initial camera position:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class PMTilesStyleURL: UIViewController {","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","        let mapView = MLNMapView(","            frame: view.bounds,","            styleURL: URL(string: \"https:\/\/demotiles.maplibre.org\/pmtiles\/raster\/style-imagery.json\")!","        )","        mapView.autoresizingMask = [.flexibleWidth, .flexibleHeight]","        mapView.setCenter(CLLocationCoordinate2D(latitude: 47.5, longitude: 12.0), zoomLevel: 9, animated: false)","        view.addSubview(mapView)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Adding-a-PMTiles-source-directly","text":"Adding a PMTiles source directly","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add "},{"code":"vector","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" sources from PMTiles archives to an already-loaded style. The example overlays two places datasets — "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/overturemaps.org\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" (yellow) and "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/opensource.foursquare.com\/os-places\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" (blue) — both using "},{"code":"MLNCircleStyleLayer","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The "},{"code":"sourceLayerIdentifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" names the layer within the archive to render:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class PMTilesAddSource: UIViewController, MLNMapViewDelegate {","    var mapView: MLNMapView!","","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","        mapView = MLNMapView(frame: view.bounds)","        mapView.autoresizingMask = [.flexibleWidth, .flexibleHeight]","        mapView.delegate = self","        view.addSubview(mapView)","    }","","    func mapView(_: MLNMapView, didFinishLoading style: MLNStyle) {","        let overtureURL = URL(string: \"pmtiles:\/\/https:\/\/overturemaps-tiles-us-west-2-beta.s3.amazonaws.com\/2026-01-21\/places.pmtiles\")!","        let overtureSource = MLNVectorTileSource(identifier: \"overture-places\", configurationURL: overtureURL)","        style.addSource(overtureSource)","        let overtureLayer = MLNCircleStyleLayer(identifier: \"overture-layer\", source: overtureSource)","        overtureLayer.sourceLayerIdentifier = \"place\"","        overtureLayer.circleColor = NSExpression(forConstantValue: UIColor(red: 0.96, green: 0.78, blue: 0.0, alpha: 1))","        overtureLayer.circleRadius = NSExpression(forConstantValue: 4)","        overtureLayer.circleOpacity = NSExpression(forConstantValue: 0.6)","        style.addLayer(overtureLayer)","","        let foursquareURL = URL(string: \"pmtiles:\/\/https:\/\/oliverwipfli.ch\/data\/foursquare-os-places-10M-2024-11-20.pmtiles\")!","        let foursquareSource = MLNVectorTileSource(identifier: \"foursquare-places\", configurationURL: foursquareURL)","        style.addSource(foursquareSource)","        let foursquareLayer = MLNCircleStyleLayer(identifier: \"foursquare-layer\", source: foursquareSource)","        foursquareLayer.sourceLayerIdentifier = \"place\"","        foursquareLayer.circleColor = NSExpression(forConstantValue: UIColor(red: 0.18, green: 0.85, blue: 1.0, alpha: 1))","        foursquareLayer.circleRadius = NSExpression(forConstantValue: 4)","        foursquareLayer.circleOpacity = NSExpression(forConstantValue: 0.6)","        style.addLayer(foursquareLayer)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The same pattern works for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"raster"},{"type":"text","text":" archives using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MLNRasterTileSource"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MLNRasterStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class PMTilesRasterSource: UIViewController, MLNMapViewDelegate {","    var mapView: MLNMapView!","","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","        mapView = MLNMapView(frame: view.bounds)","        mapView.autoresizingMask = [.flexibleWidth, .flexibleHeight]","        mapView.delegate = self","        view.addSubview(mapView)","    }","","    func mapView(_: MLNMapView, didFinishLoading style: MLNStyle) {","        let url = URL(string: \"pmtiles:\/\/https:\/\/demotiles.maplibre.org\/pmtiles\/raster\/imagery.pmtiles\")!","        let source = MLNRasterTileSource(identifier: \"imagery\", configurationURL: url, tileSize: 256)","        style.addSource(source)","        let layer = MLNRasterStyleLayer(identifier: \"imagery\", source: source)","        style.addLayer(layer)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"raster-dem","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" sources added programmatically cannot specify ","type":"text"},{"code":"encoding","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" via the current iOS API. Define ","type":"text"},{"code":"raster-dem","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" sources with terrarium encoding in the style JSON instead, where the ","type":"text"},{"code":"encoding","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" field is fully supported.","type":"text"}]}]},{"text":"Loading a local PMTiles file","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Loading-a-local-PMTiles-file"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bundle a "},{"code":".pmtiles","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" file in your app target and reference it using its bundle URL. iOS app bundle files are accessible via "},{"code":"file:\/\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so no special handling is needed:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class PMTilesLocalFile: UIViewController, MLNMapViewDelegate {","    var mapView: MLNMapView!","","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","        mapView = MLNMapView(frame: view.bounds)","        mapView.autoresizingMask = [.flexibleWidth, .flexibleHeight]","        mapView.delegate = self","        view.addSubview(mapView)","    }","","    func mapView(_: MLNMapView, didFinishLoading style: MLNStyle) {","        guard let fileURL = Bundle.main.url(forResource: \"world\", withExtension: \"pmtiles\") else { return }","        let url = URL(string: \"pmtiles:\/\/\\(fileURL.absoluteString)\")!","        let source = MLNVectorTileSource(identifier: \"world\", configurationURL: url)","        style.addSource(source)","        let layer = MLNFillStyleLayer(identifier: \"countries\", source: source)","        layer.sourceLayerIdentifier = \"countries\"","        layer.fillColor = NSExpression(forConstantValue: UIColor(red: 0.67, green: 0.83, blue: 0.87, alpha: 1))","        style.addLayer(layer)","    }","}"]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/pmtiles"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Working with PMTiles","type":"text"}],"references":{"https://maplibre.org/maplibre-style-spec/sources/":{"title":"tile source type","identifier":"https:\/\/maplibre.org\/maplibre-style-spec\/sources\/","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"tile source type"}],"url":"https:\/\/maplibre.org\/maplibre-style-spec\/sources\/"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNLineStyleLayer":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNLineStyleLayer"},{"text":" is a style layer that renders one or more stroked","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"polylines on the map.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnlinestylelayer","fragments":[{"text":"MLNLineStyleLayer","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNLineStyleLayer","role":"symbol","title":"MLNLineStyleLayer"},"https://docs.protomaps.com/pmtiles/":{"title":"PMTiles","identifier":"https:\/\/docs.protomaps.com\/pmtiles\/","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PMTiles"}],"url":"https:\/\/docs.protomaps.com\/pmtiles\/"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","role":"collection","title":"MapLibre"},"https://opensource.foursquare.com/os-places/":{"title":"Foursquare OS Places","identifier":"https:\/\/opensource.foursquare.com\/os-places\/","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Foursquare OS Places"}],"url":"https:\/\/opensource.foursquare.com\/os-places\/"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/GeoJSON":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/geojson","ti